// Xem bằng mắt Task 2 (D-032): chụp ba hệ người ngày / đêm + ?crowd=off, đếm lệnh vẽ khi bật / tắt từng hệ, gom console.
import { mkdirSync } from 'node:fs';
import { serveDir, launch, frames } from 'file:///D:/2026%20-%20Tuan/danang-vite/tests/lib.mjs';

const OUT = 'D:/2026 - Tuan/danang-vite/tests/screens/';
mkdirSync(OUT, { recursive: true });
const srv = await serveDir('D:/2026 - Tuan/danang-vite/dist');
const browser = await launch();
const log = [];

async function open(q) {
  const page = await browser.newPage({ viewport: { width: 960, height: 540 } });
  page.setDefaultTimeout(600000);
  const msgs = [], reqs = [];
  page.on('pageerror', (e) => msgs.push('pageerror ' + e));
  page.on('console', (m) => { if (m.type() !== 'log' && m.type() !== 'debug' && m.type() !== 'info') msgs.push(m.type() + ' ' + m.text()); });
  page.on('request', (r) => { if (/people\/crowd\./.test(r.url())) reqs.push(r.url()); });
  await page.route(/fonts\.(googleapis|gstatic)\.com|googletagmanager/, (r) => r.abort());
  await page.goto(srv.url + '?test' + q, { waitUntil: 'load', timeout: 600000 });
  await page.waitForFunction(() => window.__app && document.getElementById('loading')?.classList.contains('done'), null, { timeout: 600000 });
  return { page, msgs, reqs };
}
const hideUi = (page) => page.evaluate(() => document.querySelectorAll('body *').forEach((e) => { if (!e.matches('canvas') && !e.querySelector('canvas')) e.style.visibility = 'hidden'; }));
const setNight = async (page, v) => {
  await page.evaluate((v) => { window.__app.dayNight.target = v; window.__app.dayNight.night = v; }, v);
  await frames(page, 4);
};
/* Đặt camera cạnh một người đang đi (kind) của hệ name: lệch ngang side m, cao up m */
const aim = (page, name, kind, k, back, side, up) => page.evaluate(([name, kind, k, back, side, up]) => {
  const { scene, camera, controls, THREE, people } = window.__app;
  const g = scene.getObjectByName(name), ps = people.positions(name).filter((p) => p.kind === kind);
  const p = ps[Math.min(k, ps.length - 1)], w = new THREE.Vector3(p.x, p.y, p.z); g.parent.updateMatrixWorld(); g.localToWorld(w);
  const f = new THREE.Vector3(...p.fwd); g.parent.updateMatrixWorld(); const q = new THREE.Quaternion(); g.getWorldQuaternion(q); f.applyQuaternion(q);
  const sideV = new THREE.Vector3(-f.z, 0, f.x);
  camera.position.copy(w).addScaledVector(f, back).addScaledVector(sideV, side); camera.position.y += up;
  controls.target.copy(w); controls.target.y += 0.9; controls.update();
  return { w: w.toArray().map((v) => +v.toFixed(2)), n: ps.length };
}, [name, kind, k, back, side, up]);

const SYS = ['dragon-people', 'ttl-people', 'sh-people'];
const shots = [];
{
  const { page, msgs, reqs } = await open('');
  await hideUi(page);
  const info = await page.evaluate(() => ({ sys: window.__app.people.systems(), lights: { set: window.__app.lights.set, mode: window.__app.lights.mode }, md: window.__app.renderer.extensions.has('WEBGL_multi_draw'), progs: window.__app.renderer.info.programs.length }));
  log.push(['systems', JSON.stringify(info)]);
  log.push(['requests', reqs.length]);
  for (const night of [0, 1]) {
    await setNight(page, night);
    for (const name of SYS) {
      const where = await aim(page, name, 'walk', 3, 6, 5, 1.2);
      await frames(page, 3);
      const file = `${OUT}crowd-${name}-${night ? 'dem' : 'ngay'}.png`;
      await page.screenshot({ path: file }); shots.push(file);
      // lệnh vẽ: bật / tắt nhóm hệ này
      const calls = await page.evaluate(async (name) => {
        const { scene, renderer } = window.__app, g = scene.getObjectByName(name);
        const one = () => new Promise((ok) => requestAnimationFrame(() => requestAnimationFrame(() => ok(renderer.info.render.calls))));
        const on = await one(); g.visible = false; const off = await one(); g.visible = true; const on2 = await one();
        return { on, off, on2 };
      }, name);
      log.push([`${name} ${night ? 'đêm' : 'ngày'}`, JSON.stringify({ where, calls, lights: await page.evaluate(() => window.__app.lights.set) })]);
    }
    // người đứng / chụp ảnh và người chạy ở Cầu Rồng
    await aim(page, 'dragon-people', 'stand', 0, 4, 4, 1.0); await frames(page, 3);
    let f = `${OUT}crowd-dragon-stand-${night ? 'dem' : 'ngay'}.png`; await page.screenshot({ path: f }); shots.push(f);
    if (!night) { await aim(page, 'ttl-people', 'run', 0, 5, 4, 1.0); await frames(page, 3); f = `${OUT}crowd-ttl-run-ngay.png`; await page.screenshot({ path: f }); shots.push(f); }
  }
  // quay lưng lại Cầu Rồng (gần): dragon-people không tốn lệnh vẽ
  await setNight(page, 0);
  const back = await page.evaluate(async () => {
    const { scene, renderer, camera, controls } = window.__app, g = scene.getObjectByName('dragon-people');
    camera.position.set(0, 30, -300); controls.target.set(0, 30, -600); controls.update();
    const one = () => new Promise((ok) => requestAnimationFrame(() => requestAnimationFrame(() => ok(renderer.info.render.calls))));
    const on = await one(); g.visible = false; const off = await one(); g.visible = true;
    return { on, off };
  });
  log.push(['dragon quay lưng', JSON.stringify(back)]);
  log.push(['console', JSON.stringify(msgs)]);
  await page.close();
}
{
  const { page, msgs, reqs } = await open('&crowd=off');
  await hideUi(page);
  log.push(['off systems', JSON.stringify(await page.evaluate(() => window.__app.people.systems().map((s) => [s.name, s.real, s.materialName, s.verts]))))]);
  await aim(page, 'dragon-people', 'walk', 3, 6, 5, 1.2); await frames(page, 3);
  const f = `${OUT}crowd-off-dragon-ngay.png`; await page.screenshot({ path: f }); shots.push(f);
  log.push(['off requests', JSON.stringify(reqs)]);
  log.push(['off console', JSON.stringify(msgs)]);
  await page.close();
}
await browser.close(); srv.close();
for (const [k, v] of log) console.log(k, '|', v);
console.log(shots.join('\n'));

